Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up. If brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something definitely isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I see any idiot G-5\Nmarines at the main entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be looking at a pile of\Nsolidified bodies, but nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't prove the power of my land\Nof the dead without those corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we don't have their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,how can we be sure the Straw\NHat's law and smoker are dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Vergo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing we can be sure of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened, Straw Hat and\Nthe others are not in that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They got free?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy G-5 is nothing but\Na bunch of useless meatheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt they will be able\Nto escape from the gas on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and the rest escaped the cage\Nand helped the G-5 Marines as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They broke out impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat, the Navy, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here, they're inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away from the poison gas\Nand they're in Building A now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all about to advance further\Ninto the laboratory. They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't have been\Nable to get out of that cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone make it through\Nthe laboratory door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,More than anything, I don't like\Nthat laws are the loose now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,depending on what he intends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I may need to take care of him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're closing in! Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats and Marines\Nbroke through our defenses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and are trying to push through\Nthe lab toward the passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on, Luis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That Master guy really\Nmakes my skin crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least I know the\Nothers are okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave me this note?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they telling me that Luffy and the\Nothers could make it out on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I know the formula for the drug\Nand have the sedatives, I can help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea which way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what my men are doing about this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,troops have mobilized\Nagainst them in building
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A the main unit. They're\Nposted at the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,of building B preparing\Nto make a stand sir
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We know what they're after\Nescape away off the island
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means we know\Nwhere they're heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll make a beeline for\Nbuilding our and gate 66.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no we stop them before they get close
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gate between the two\Nbuildings and isolate building A.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, use the experiment\Ncannon and let in land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if we do that, we'll be\Nleaving our own guards to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You will do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And place a surveillance nail, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? But... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Broker's benefit, we need\Nto restart this little experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have yet to satisfactorily\Ndemonstrate my scientific mastery
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do, Vergo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a bunch of idiots will fall\Nfor the trap you're setting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who would lose\Nface if we let Law and Smoker get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a stake in this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't trust you to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut down whoever\Nand whatever I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Likely because you're\Nnot a swordsman, oh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right, forgot that for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'll strike them\Ndown every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your worst, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of building B's\Ngatekeepers in my pirate days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was called run the machete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I served the master,\Nand you are his enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look like animal legs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of Century are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freaky! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Law, what's the siren?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate in this building\Nis about to close,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,cutting off the only\Npassage to Building B,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,boxing us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he make it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your men better get moving, or\Nelse they're not making it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Law meant when he said\Nwe only had two hours to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do know we're not going\Nto let you get away, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride, Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe you one. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I am curious why\Nyou brought the dragon along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,our original plan was to get away from\Nthe poison gas by flying on his back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:08:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But he never even got off the ground. He\Ncan't fly now because he's been injected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,with sedatives even so it would have been\Na better idea to leave him outside and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,here he could do a lot of damage he's\Ndangerous really he's kind of cute though
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this might be our only chance\Nlet's take the stars down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,now I thought I told you to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way, huh? But
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,captain why well hello copycat\Na captain now huh what's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wrong don't want to fight me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,no get the hell out of here stop
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,g5 we don't have the time to\Nbe fighting right now head
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,for the back passage immediately\Nthe only way out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,building is about to be\Nsealed we need to get out now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,caesar's ordered the gate closed\Nhe's trying to fence us in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,this is our chance to escape if\Nwe don't make it out we'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,stuck on punk hazard move faster\Nwe die quick let's get moving
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you all heard the captain if we\Ndon't do as she says we're dead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,come on let's go straight for\Nthe gate don't stop for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy asked me to do a\Nlittle favor for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her, right, the Navy captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace, brownie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick to death of all this running!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you tired? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a samurai, so I\Nhave no problem saying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's Brownbeard\Ndoing helping out those pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he even think\Nof betraying the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a traitor to the great savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For now we need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chief Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna close any minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiment cannons, stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Target!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Third laboratory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After the wall of Building A!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Two walls been breached!\NHey, wait! That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll close any second now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone left on this side will be a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain just came\Nflying in through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.36,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still Marines out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is almost close now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave them behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me to look out for the men!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Captain is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done the Navy proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou scum, I can't believe\Nso many of them survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he\Ncompromised his own land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He must really want us all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you run any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you all get on my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's getting too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to forgive us, Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just power through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we've got no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been running all day, and now we\Ndon't want to that's an awful reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is brownbeard correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It pains me to ask this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But my son is being held captive and I\Nneed to rescue him as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I need your help because\NI am simply too tired to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually starting to feel kind of\Nstuffy in this lab with this heavy coat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hang it with mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my back's not allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not hurt, get\Ndown and run for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a bit hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A summoner eye is trained to\Nendure the pains of hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Brownbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any snacks stored back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we get back to the\Npost where my men are stationed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bucking you all off\Nand going my own way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to warn people\Nabout the deadly crap
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,this scum sucker's been\Nmaking on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't let them unleash\Nthat stuff on the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to report all\Nthis to Navy HQ now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If none of us make it\Noff Punk Hazard alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,then all those guys who sacrificed\Nthemselves to save you died for squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's making that weird noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's something\Nin the dark up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a damn monster! That thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it get inside the\Nlab with a Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever told me lizards can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't, and we're\Nnot looking at a lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that there were dragons on\Nthis island, but I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're more than just legend. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk genetically engineered them\Nto protect Punk Hazard from outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked so much nicer\Nwhen we saw it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dark bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chewing through solid steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of what those jaws would do to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To Building B!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It flies, breathes fire, and eats steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we ever gonna beat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying off! Where's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like something freaked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got a look at Captain Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Tashigi, we're saved at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The big guns have arrived\Nto provide us some backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We got two Vice-Admirals on our side now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Smokey and Vergo, the\NG5 is finally ready to kick some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no one gonna stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Vergo, did those soldiers\Ndo something wrong? Even if they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all for punishment and everything,\Nbut your finger pistol might kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to G5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reputation precedes\Nyou, Commodore Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know the soldiers of G5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're a bit crude and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you give them a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll find they're not as bad\Nas people make them out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, they're some of the\Nmost loyal men you'll ever meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Vice Admiral Brook? Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See, the Vice Admiral has to take leave\Nto visit home every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines are supposed to help people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,See, these men, I'm responsible for\Ntheir failure. Yeah? Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take some real responsibility\Nand fix my damn house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, better watch your mouth, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree with you, and I promise you that\Nyour home will be fixed, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, about that child abduction\Nreport from the other day. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered some men to look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.24,0:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems as though it was an accident at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Another false report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's difficult for any parent to\Naccept the death of their child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But calling it an abduction gives\Nthem some hope they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll understand yourself\Nsomeday when you become a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's really all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the man you think he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been working against -
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Vergo would never attack\Nhis own soldiers like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's a disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a Devil Fruit power! You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you pretend to\Nbe Vice Admiral Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vice Admiral Usgeist, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a man of honor who\Nalways stands up for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're a bunch of misfits,\Nand he believes in justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way you're him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kick his ass backwards! E-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My words are frozen in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear a lady. Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In need of my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that guy a Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is a pirate helping us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the heartbreaking\Nsound of a woman's tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Sanji took\Noff in a mad dash like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt the presence of\Nsomeone dangerous creeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have gone after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, something's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the dragon we\Ndidn't ride here on. Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks different somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons are pretty savage by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to control the beast\Nis pump them full of sedatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Smaller ones like him are the\Nnewer, more advanced models.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's even faster and\Ntougher than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to rearrange Caesar's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to straighten\Nout Vergo with my fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not with Caesar, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.98,0:20:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does Vergo think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it clear those G5\Nguys are my test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot's not supposed to kill them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,land of the dead is what a\Ndamn waste I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the doors and seal off\Nthe passage ahead of them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and then open up the other\Ngates to let the gas in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but do you want me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With Vergo still inside, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't have gone rogue\Non me; it's his own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the biscuit room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I was running so fast my\Nfeet let the damn floor on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just go flying on a smoke cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when I'm ready, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to catch my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear me say I was ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And you keep away from Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one taking down that jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm up first. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These are secure!
